      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of storing prev_mode, how about we only call charger_set_option if we\u0027re changing the inhibit bit (skip charger_set_option if option is unchanged). Then, a normal call to charger_set_mode will consist of one read, instead of one read + one write.. which isn\u0027t as good as skipping everything, but it\u0027s much less hacky. We can leave in the read-twice code, but please add a comment in the code about it.",
